```
Caching many thumbnails could grow; cap 60:
```
const shinyKeys = [];
if length > 60 delete oldest.
```
Need not dispose geometries because shared across models? buildCreature creates some unique geometries (torus etc.) each call, but not disposing is leak. For a handful, okay. Could traverse and dispose only geometries with userData? Materials cloned too. Hard to know. We'll leave; cap 60.

Also set `tr.setSize(300,300,false)`.

For shiny thumbnail rotation, `buildCreature(mon)`, rotation.y=0.22.

